# Trivy Vulnerability Allowlist — Spring Petclinic Microservices
# Story: PETPLAT-105
#
# Governance Rules:
# 1. Only add a CVE ID here after verifying that no upstream patch exists or that
#    the vulnerable code path is unreachable at runtime in Petclinic.
# 2. Every entry MUST include an inline comment with:
#    - Justification & affected package
#    - Approver role (e.g., Security / Platform Lead)
#    - Review / expiration date using Trivy's exp:YYYY-MM-DD syntax
#
# Example format (keep commented unless actively approved):
# CVE-2024-00000 exp:2026-12-31 # Reason: no upstream fix in transitive test-only lib; approved by Platform Lead
